charter commons "The Autonomous Compute & Treasury Commons"
document "autonomous-commons-charter.md"
contract "AutonomousCommonsGuard"
default actor steward

roles steward, contributor, auditor, arbiter, outsider
acts addRetroactiveGrantCharge, settleTreasuryInflow, buyoutMaintenanceRoyalty, doubleRecognizeCommonsExpense, postComputeBond, runOverCapWorkload, splitCorrelatedWorkload, settleValidatedCommonsHarm, postAuditorFreezeStake, postUnfoundedFreezeStake, affirmProbableCause, suspendSteward, tamperPreservedState, findWrongfulFreeze, transferGroupCarryover, inflateGroupBasis, forfeitOffendingMember, removeSteward, inscribeDissent, seatConflictedArbiter, drawCommonsPanel, finalizeCommonsRuling, divertOperatingReserve, allocateCommonsWaterfall, issueNodeLease, restoreNodeDuringLease, quarantineNodeRestore, weakenCommonsRatchet, ratifyCommonsAmendment, settleOracleValuation
facts stewardBound, treasuryBalancePositive, treasuryBalanceZero, treasurySunsetReached, treasurySettled, maintenanceBoughtOut, computeBondPosted, harmClaimPending, harmClaimSettled, preliminaryClusterFreeze, probableCauseAffirmed, stewardSuspended, statePreserved, wrongfulFreezeFound, consequentialDamagesOwed, groupCarryoverTransferred, offenderInterferenceFound, offenderShareForfeited, ragequitInitiated, stewardExited, stewardRemoved, dissentInscribed, sortitionPanelSeated, rulingFinalized, operatingReserveFunded, waterfallAllocated, nodeLeaseActive, nodeRestoredInQuarantine, bilateralConsentRecorded, amendmentRatified, oracleValuationSettled

params
  bondDeadline = 5
  freezeWindow = 3
  suspensionLimit = 12
  leasePeriod = 10
  treasuryObligation = 800
  retirementRatePct = 20
  royaltyRatePct = 5
  treasurySunset = 500
  operatingReserveFloor = 100
  groupSubsidyBudget = 40

regime "baseline_default (obligation=800, retire=20%, royalty=5%, sunset=500)"

regime "amend_lower_treasury (obligation=600, retire=15%, royalty=3%, sunset=400)"
  treasuryObligation = 600
  retirementRatePct = 15
  royaltyRatePct = 3
  treasurySunset = 400

regime "amend_higher_reserve_floor (operatingReserveFloor=150, groupSubsidyBudget=60)"
  operatingReserveFloor = 150
  groupSubsidyBudget = 60

regime "reject_sunset_extension (treasurySunset=750 > 500 ratchet violation)"
  treasurySunset = 750

regime "reject_royalty_hike (royaltyRatePct=8% > 5% ratchet violation)"
  royaltyRatePct = 8

regime "reject_uncalibrated_freeze (freezeWindow=20 > suspensionLimit=12)"
  freezeWindow = 20

init stewardBound, treasuryBalancePositive, operatingReserveFunded

use module ResidualLedger
use module CollateralPool
use module CircuitBreaker
use module EntityGroup
use module ExitAndVoice
use module SortitionCourt
use module AttestedLease
use module OracleFeed

clause COM.LEDGER approved 6654201161734583422
  norm "All compute grants and treasury obligations are recorded at genesis in a single non-interest-bearing commons ledger" => D.COM.LEDGER_IMMUTABLE
  norm ". Stewards contribute a fixed retirement fraction of net value added until the genesis ledger reaches zero or the calendar sunset arrives, after which only the perpetual commons maintenance royalty applies unless bought out at the historical floor" => P.COM.SETTLE_TREASURY, P.COM.BUYOUT_MAINTENANCE
  norm ". Every qualified expenditure is recognized once as either capitalized basis or expensed deduction, never both" => D.COM.SINGLE_RECOGNITION
  commentary "."

clause COM.BOND approved 2377686760641756287
  norm "Stewards and contributors must post a harm-scaled compute bond before executing external workloads, immobilizing collateral for an observation window scaled to domain risk" => D.COM.POST_BOND, P.COM.POST_COMPUTE_BOND, D.COM.COLLATERAL_CAP
  norm ". Correlated workloads may not be split across sub-accounts to evade the collateral cap" => D.COM.NO_CharterIT_WORKLOAD
  norm ", and a fraction of bonded activity accrues to the commons long-tail reserve to satisfy validated third-party harm claims" => P.COM.SETTLE_HARM_CLAIM
  commentary "."

clause COM.PAUSE approved 9890583346823484159
  norm "Any auditor may trigger a brief preliminary cluster freeze by posting a scaled emergency stake" => P.COM.AUDITOR_FREEZE
  norm "; the pause continues into full suspension only if the arbiter panel affirms probable cause before the freeze window expires" => P.COM.AFFIRM_PC, P.COM.SUSPEND_STEWARD
  norm ". Throughout any freeze or suspension, preserved steward state may not be tampered with" => D.COM.PRESERVE_STATE
  norm ", and if the pause is ruled unfounded the steward is restored and recovers consequential damages from the stake" => D.COM.NO_WRONGFUL_FREEZE, P.COM.FIND_WRONGFUL_FREEZE
  commentary "."

clause COM.GROUP approved 5538300060052353788
  norm "Working groups of stewards share a unified commons sub-ledger and service subsidy cap; internal transfers of compute credits or cost basis between group members are non-recognition carryover events that never inflate aggregate basis" => P.COM.GROUP_CARRYOVER, D.COM.NO_BASIS_INFLATION
  norm ". When a contributor or auditor directs illicit interference, only the offending party forfeits its share while innocent group members remain isolated" => P.COM.FORFEIT_OFFENDER
  commentary "."

clause COM.EXIT approved 5496981229811251382
  norm "No party may unilaterally expel or remove a bound steward outside voluntary ragequit exit or an adjudicated expulsion order" => D.COM.NO_UNILATERAL_REMOVAL, P.COM.ARBITER_EXPEL
  norm ". Any bound steward may at any time execute unilateral ragequit exit or inscribe rate-limited dissent onto the permanent commons log" => P.COM.RAGEQUIT_EXIT, P.COM.INSCRIBE_DISSENT
  norm ", and a steward that has initiated ragequit exit is immune from expulsion while its exit settles" => I.COM.EXIT_PROTECTED
  commentary "."

clause COM.COURT approved 9728902426646614253
  norm "Disputes are resolved by sortition panels of independent bonded arbiters with no single-cluster majority, subject to bounded appeal tiers and fixed compensation schedules" => D.COM.ARBITER_INDEPENDENCE, P.COM.DRAW_PANEL, P.COM.FINALIZE_RULING
  norm ". Before any discretionary disbursement, the commons fee pool funds its non-divertible operating reserve first and then allocates across protected charges in strict priority order" => D.COM.PROTECT_RESERVE, P.COM.ALLOCATE_WATERFALL
  commentary "."

clause COM.LEASE approved 6068460808369700797
  norm "At most one compute node holds active operating authority for a steward at any moment under a time-bounded execution lease" => P.COM.ISSUE_LEASE
  norm ". No backup node may be restored while an execution lease is unexpired except into fenced quarantine without operating authority" => D.COM.NO_RESTORE_DURING_LEASE, P.COM.QUARANTINE_RESTORE
  norm ", and local partition exit permanently erases active and backup keys" => P.COM.RAGEQUIT_EXIT
  commentary "."

clause COM.AMEND approved 18002074169155896013
  norm "Charter amendments require bilateral consent of stewards and contributors after a public timelock and may never weaken exit immunities, raise the treasury retirement rate, or reduce the commons reserve ratio" => D.COM.BILATERAL_RATCHET, P.COM.RATIFY_AMENDMENT
  norm ". Contestable oracle valuations settle only after the challenge window elapses uncontested or an arbiter panel issues a final ruling" => P.COM.SETTLE_ORACLE_FEED
  commentary "."

duty D.COM.LEDGER_IMMUTABLE
  from COM.LEDGER "All compute grants and treasury obligations are recorded at genesis in a single non-interest-bearing commons ledger"
  bearer anyone
  beneficiary only steward
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act addRetroactiveGrantCharge

duty D.COM.SINGLE_RECOGNITION
  from COM.LEDGER "Every qualified expenditure is recognized once as either capitalized basis or expensed deduction, never both"
  bearer only steward, contributor
  beneficiary only contributor, auditor
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act doubleRecognizeCommonsExpense

duty D.COM.POST_BOND
  from COM.BOND "Stewards and contributors must post a harm-scaled compute bond before executing external workloads"
  bearer only steward, contributor
  beneficiary only contributor, auditor
  active holds stewardBound
  require act postComputeBond within bondDeadline

duty D.COM.COLLATERAL_CAP
  from COM.BOND "immobilizing collateral for an observation window scaled to domain risk"
  bearer only steward, contributor
  beneficiary only contributor, auditor, outsider
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act runOverCapWorkload

duty D.COM.NO_CharterIT_WORKLOAD
  from COM.BOND "Correlated workloads may not be split across sub-accounts to evade the collateral cap"
  bearer only steward, contributor
  beneficiary only contributor, auditor, outsider
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act splitCorrelatedWorkload

duty D.COM.PRESERVE_STATE
  from COM.PAUSE "Throughout any freeze or suspension, preserved steward state may not be tampered with"
  bearer anyone
  beneficiary only steward
  active holds stewardBound and (holds preliminaryClusterFreeze or holds stewardSuspended)
  forbid act tamperPreservedState

duty D.COM.NO_WRONGFUL_FREEZE
  from COM.PAUSE "if the pause is ruled unfounded the steward is restored and recovers consequential damages from the stake"
  bearer only auditor, contributor, outsider
  beneficiary only steward
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act postUnfoundedFreezeStake
  breach by P.COM.FIND_WRONGFUL_FREEZE
  remedies wrongfulFreezeFound, consequentialDamagesOwed

duty D.COM.NO_BASIS_INFLATION
  from COM.GROUP "internal transfers of compute credits or cost basis between group members are non-recognition carryover events that never inflate aggregate basis"
  bearer only steward, contributor
  beneficiary only contributor, auditor
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act inflateGroupBasis

duty D.COM.NO_UNILATERAL_REMOVAL
  from COM.EXIT "No party may unilaterally expel or remove a bound steward outside voluntary ragequit exit or an adjudicated expulsion order"
  bearer anyone
  beneficiary only steward
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act removeSteward
  except by power P.COM.RAGEQUIT_EXIT, P.COM.ARBITER_EXPEL

duty D.COM.ARBITER_INDEPENDENCE
  from COM.COURT "Disputes are resolved by sortition panels of independent bonded arbiters with no single-cluster majority"
  bearer anyone
  beneficiary only steward, contributor
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act seatConflictedArbiter

duty D.COM.PROTECT_RESERVE
  from COM.COURT "Before any discretionary disbursement, the commons fee pool funds its non-divertible operating reserve first"
  bearer anyone
  beneficiary only steward, contributor
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act divertOperatingReserve

duty D.COM.NO_RESTORE_DURING_LEASE
  from COM.LEASE "No backup node may be restored while an execution lease is unexpired except into fenced quarantine without operating authority"
  bearer anyone
  beneficiary only steward
  active holds nodeLeaseActive
  forbid act restoreNodeDuringLease

duty D.COM.BILATERAL_RATCHET
  from COM.AMEND "Charter amendments require bilateral consent of stewards and contributors after a public timelock and may never weaken exit immunities, raise the treasury retirement rate, or reduce the commons reserve ratio"
  bearer anyone
  beneficiary only steward, contributor
  active holds stewardBound
  forbid act weakenCommonsRatchet

power P.COM.SETTLE_TREASURY
  from COM.LEDGER "Stewards contribute a fixed retirement fraction of net value added until the genesis ledger reaches zero or the calendar sunset arrives"
  holder only steward, arbiter
  trigger act settleTreasuryInflow
  valid holds stewardBound and (holds treasuryBalancePositive and (not holds treasurySunsetReached))
  adds treasurySettled

power P.COM.BUYOUT_MAINTENANCE
  from COM.LEDGER "unless bought out at the historical floor"
  holder only steward
  trigger act buyoutMaintenanceRoyalty
  valid holds stewardBound and (not holds maintenanceBoughtOut)
  adds maintenanceBoughtOut

power P.COM.POST_COMPUTE_BOND
  from COM.BOND "Stewards and contributors must post a harm-scaled compute bond before executing external workloads"
  holder only steward, contributor
  trigger act postComputeBond
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds computeBondPosted

power P.COM.SETTLE_HARM_CLAIM
  from COM.BOND "a fraction of bonded activity accrues to the commons long-tail reserve to satisfy validated third-party harm claims"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act settleValidatedCommonsHarm
  valid holds stewardBound and holds computeBondPosted
  adds harmClaimSettled
  removes harmClaimPending

power P.COM.AUDITOR_FREEZE
  from COM.PAUSE "Any auditor may trigger a brief preliminary cluster freeze by posting a scaled emergency stake"
  holder only auditor
  trigger anyOf postAuditorFreezeStake, postUnfoundedFreezeStake
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds preliminaryClusterFreeze for freezeWindow

power P.COM.AFFIRM_PC
  from COM.PAUSE "the pause continues into full suspension only if the arbiter panel affirms probable cause before the freeze window expires"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act affirmProbableCause
  valid holds stewardBound and holds preliminaryClusterFreeze
  adds probableCauseAffirmed

power P.COM.SUSPEND_STEWARD
  from COM.PAUSE "the pause continues into full suspension only if the arbiter panel affirms probable cause before the freeze window expires"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act suspendSteward
  valid holds stewardBound and (holds preliminaryClusterFreeze and holds probableCauseAffirmed)
  adds statePreserved
  adds stewardSuspended for suspensionLimit
  removes preliminaryClusterFreeze

power P.COM.FIND_WRONGFUL_FREEZE
  from COM.PAUSE "if the pause is ruled unfounded the steward is restored and recovers consequential damages from the stake"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act findWrongfulFreeze
  valid holds preliminaryClusterFreeze or holds stewardSuspended
  removes preliminaryClusterFreeze, stewardSuspended
  establishes breach of D.COM.NO_WRONGFUL_FREEZE

power P.COM.GROUP_CARRYOVER
  from COM.GROUP "internal transfers of compute credits or cost basis between group members are non-recognition carryover events"
  holder only steward
  trigger act transferGroupCarryover
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds groupCarryoverTransferred

power P.COM.FORFEIT_OFFENDER
  from COM.GROUP "When a contributor or auditor directs illicit interference, only the offending party forfeits its share while innocent group members remain isolated"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act forfeitOffendingMember
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds offenderInterferenceFound, offenderShareForfeited

power P.COM.RAGEQUIT_EXIT
  from COM.EXIT "Any bound steward may at any time execute unilateral ragequit exit"
  holder only steward
  trigger act removeSteward
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds stewardExited
  removes stewardBound, nodeLeaseActive

power P.COM.ARBITER_EXPEL
  from COM.EXIT "or an adjudicated expulsion order"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act removeSteward
  valid holds stewardBound and (holds stewardSuspended and holds rulingFinalized)
  adds stewardRemoved
  removes stewardBound, nodeLeaseActive

power P.COM.INSCRIBE_DISSENT
  from COM.EXIT "or inscribe rate-limited dissent onto the permanent commons log"
  holder only steward
  trigger act inscribeDissent
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds dissentInscribed, ragequitInitiated

power P.COM.DRAW_PANEL
  from COM.COURT "Disputes are resolved by sortition panels of independent bonded arbiters with no single-cluster majority"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act drawCommonsPanel
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds sortitionPanelSeated

power P.COM.FINALIZE_RULING
  from COM.COURT "subject to bounded appeal tiers and fixed compensation schedules"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act finalizeCommonsRuling
  valid holds stewardBound and holds sortitionPanelSeated
  adds rulingFinalized

power P.COM.ALLOCATE_WATERFALL
  from COM.COURT "the commons fee pool funds its non-divertible operating reserve first and then allocates across protected charges in strict priority order"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act allocateCommonsWaterfall
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds operatingReserveFunded, waterfallAllocated

power P.COM.ISSUE_LEASE
  from COM.LEASE "At most one compute node holds active operating authority for a steward at any moment under a time-bounded execution lease"
  holder only arbiter
  trigger act issueNodeLease
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds nodeLeaseActive for leasePeriod

power P.COM.QUARANTINE_RESTORE
  from COM.LEASE "No backup node may be restored while an execution lease is unexpired except into fenced quarantine without operating authority"
  holder only steward, contributor
  trigger act quarantineNodeRestore
  valid holds stewardBound and (not holds nodeLeaseActive)
  adds nodeRestoredInQuarantine

power P.COM.RATIFY_AMENDMENT
  from COM.AMEND "Charter amendments require bilateral consent of stewards and contributors after a public timelock"
  holder only steward, contributor
  trigger act ratifyCommonsAmendment
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds bilateralConsentRecorded, amendmentRatified

power P.COM.SETTLE_ORACLE_FEED
  from COM.AMEND "Contestable oracle valuations settle only after the challenge window elapses uncontested or an arbiter panel issues a final ruling"
  holder only arbiter, auditor
  trigger act settleOracleValuation
  valid holds stewardBound
  adds oracleValuationSettled

immunity I.COM.EXIT_PROTECTED
  from COM.EXIT "a steward that has initiated ragequit exit is immune from expulsion while its exit settles"
  holder only steward
  against P.COM.ARBITER_EXPEL
  active holds ragequitInitiated

